# Env files — broad catch-all to prevent future variants (.env.bak, .env.fresh,
# .env.local.bak-20260813, .env.staging, etc.) from leaking secrets.
# Added 2026-08-14 after a .env.local.bak holding SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY,
# GHL_API_KEY and GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET was one commit away from GitHub —
# the old rule (.env*.local) only matched names ENDING in .local.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.local.example
